  p.card-text
  p Three submissions are accepted for publication at the 14th International Symposium on Visual Information Communication and Interaction (VINCI 2021).
  p VINCI is the premier international forum for researchers and industrial practitioners to discuss the state of the art in visual communication theories, designs, and applications. The 14th International Symposium on Visual Information Communication and Interaction (VINCI '21) will be held during 6–7 September 2021, in Potsdam, Germany. Accepted papers will be published in the ACM ICPS series.
